{"seq":2,"slug":"telemetry-crash","title":"遥测与崩溃分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-testing-qa/automation-ops/telemetry-crash","wordCount":1615,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"遥测与崩溃分析\">遥测与崩溃分析</h1><p>发布前的所有测试，本质都是在有限样本上预测真实世界；游戏一旦上线，几百万玩家的真机会跑出测试永远覆盖不到的状态组合。那个在 QA 机器上一周才偶发一次的崩溃，在百万玩家手里可能每分钟发生几十次。遥测与崩溃分析就是把发布后这片广阔现实变成可观测、可量化的信号——它接收 <a href=\"../specialized-testing/performance-testing\">性能与稳定性测试</a> 关注的崩溃与性能问题，让运营期的质量可度量。这一篇讲怎么采集、聚合、定位线上质量问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>线上质量观测有两条数据流：<strong>崩溃报告</strong>（程序异常终止时自动生成的转储，回答「为什么崩」）和<strong>行为遥测</strong>（玩家在游戏里的行为埋点，回答「玩家卡在哪、流失在哪」）。前者偏技术稳健性，后者偏体验与运营。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[线上玩家客户端] --&gt; B[崩溃发生]&#10;  A --&gt; C[行为埋点]&#10;  B --&gt; D[Crashpad/Breakpad&lt;br/&gt;生成 minidump]&#10;  D --&gt; E[上报崩溃平台&lt;br/&gt;Sentry 等]&#10;  E --&gt; F[符号化 + 按崩溃率聚类]&#10;  C --&gt; G[遥测管道]&#10;  G --&gt; H[漏斗/留存/卡点分析]&#10;  F --&gt; I[按崩溃率排优先级]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[喂回缺陷流程与设计]\">flowchart TD\n  A[线上玩家客户端] --&gt; B[崩溃发生]\n  A --&gt; C[行为埋点]\n  B --&gt; D[Crashpad/Breakpad&lt;br/&gt;生成 minidump]\n  D --&gt; E[上报崩溃平台&lt;br/&gt;Sentry 等]\n  E --&gt; F[符号化 + 按崩溃率聚类]\n  C --&gt; G[遥测管道]\n  G --&gt; H[漏斗/留存/卡点分析]\n  F --&gt; I[按崩溃率排优先级]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[喂回缺陷流程与设计]</pre><p>下表区分两类信号的用途：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>采集方式</th>\n<th>主要回答</th>\n<th>主要受众</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>崩溃报告</td>\n<td>minidump 转储上报</td>\n<td>为什么崩、崩在哪行代码</td>\n<td>程序员</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能遥测</td>\n<td>帧率/内存上报</td>\n<td>线上真机性能分布</td>\n<td>程序/性能团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为遥测</td>\n<td>事件埋点</td>\n<td>玩家卡点、流失漏斗</td>\n<td>设计/运营</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"崩溃捕获-crashpad-breakpad-与-minidump\">崩溃捕获：Crashpad、Breakpad 与 minidump</h2><p>当游戏崩溃时，需要在进程倒下前抓住「案发现场」。<strong>Breakpad</strong> 是 Google 开源的跨平台崩溃报告系统（支持 Windows/macOS/Linux），它的继任者 <strong>Crashpad</strong> 采用相同的传输协议，是目前更主流的方案。它们在崩溃瞬间生成 <strong>minidump</strong>——一份精简的内存转储，包含崩溃时的调用栈、线程状态、寄存器等关键信息，体积小到适合上传。</p>\n<p>minidump 本身是裸地址，要变成可读的调用栈需要<strong>符号化（symbolication）</strong>：用构建时保留的符号文件（符号表）把内存地址映射回源码的函数名与行号。所以发布构建必须妥善归档符号文件，否则线上崩溃栈是一堆无意义的十六进制。这类崩溃是典型的「难以手动复现的偶发问题」，正呼应 <a href=\"../foundations/game-qa-overview\">游戏 QA 总览与特殊性</a> 讲的「提高捕获率」策略——既然复现不出，就保证一旦发生必被记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"崩溃聚合平台与按崩溃率排序\">崩溃聚合平台与按崩溃率排序</h2><p>单个 minidump 价值有限，需要平台把成千上万份报告<strong>聚类</strong>——把同一根因导致的崩溃归为一组，统计其发生频率、影响玩家数、涉及的版本与设备。2026 年游戏领域常用 <strong>Sentry</strong>：它统一接入 Unreal、Unity、Godot 与自研引擎，跨 PC、移动、主机汇总崩溃，2025 年起还把覆盖扩展到 Xbox、PlayStation、Nintendo Switch 等主机（Switch 开发者可经任天堂开发者门户直接接入），填补了主机崩溃观测长期的空白。</p>\n<p>聚合后最关键的运营指标是<strong>崩溃率</strong>，常用「无崩溃会话率（crash-free sessions）」或「无崩溃用户率」衡量：若总会话数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、发生崩溃的会话数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则无崩溃会话率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - S_c / S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>。一个常见健康线是无崩溃会话率维持在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>99.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">99.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.5%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上。崩溃按「影响玩家数 × 发生频率」排序，自然就得到修复优先级——这和 <a href=\"../foundations/bug-lifecycle\">缺陷生命周期与分级</a> 的优先级判定逻辑一致，只是输入从人工判断换成了线上数据。一个崩溃组的严重度判定（是否阻断、是否触发主机看门狗）仍沿用同一套分级标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行为遥测-玩家在哪卡住\">行为遥测：玩家在哪卡住</h2><p>崩溃告诉你「程序坏了」，行为遥测告诉你「设计可能有问题」。通过在关键节点埋点（教程完成、关卡通过、付费、退出），团队能重建玩家的行为路径，做<strong>漏斗分析</strong>：在新手教程的第几步流失最多、哪个 Boss 让大量玩家弃游、付费转化卡在哪一环。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[启动] --&gt; B[完成教程]&#10;  B --&gt; C[通过首个 Boss]&#10;  C --&gt; D[首次付费]&#10;  D --&gt; E[7 日留存]&#10;  C --&gt; F{通过率骤降?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[设计卡点信号]\">flowchart TD\n  A[启动] --&gt; B[完成教程]\n  B --&gt; C[通过首个 Boss]\n  C --&gt; D[首次付费]\n  D --&gt; E[7 日留存]\n  C --&gt; F{通过率骤降?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[设计卡点信号]</pre><p>漏斗分析能把模糊的「这关是不是太难」变成数字：设进入某关卡的玩家数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、通过的为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，通过率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{out}/N_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 异常偏低就是设计卡点的信号。但遥测只能告诉你「玩家在这流失了」，答不了「为什么」——回答「为什么」要靠可玩性测试与定性研究（见 <a href=\"playtesting-feedback\">可玩性测试与反馈</a>）。值得强调的是，遥测属于「设计/运营信号」，不应直接灌进缺陷库污染缺陷收敛指标（见 <a href=\"../foundations/bug-lifecycle\">缺陷生命周期与分级</a>），它走的是设计反馈渠道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐私-合规与数据治理\">隐私、合规与数据治理</h2><p>遥测采集玩家数据，直接撞上隐私法规。GDPR 等要求收集前获得同意、最小化采集、允许玩家查询与删除其数据，这与 <a href=\"../specialized-testing/compliance-localization-qa\">合规与本地化测试</a> 是同一套合规约束。崩溃报告也可能无意中包含敏感信息（玩家路径里的用户名、内存里的个人数据），上报前要做脱敏。</p>\n<p>务实的数据治理原则有几条：明确告知并征得同意、只采业务真正需要的字段、对崩溃转储做敏感信息清洗、对数据设保留期限。在主机平台，遥测还要符合各平台的数据政策，这又回到认证清单的合规要求。把质量观测建立在合规的数据采集之上，是线上运营不踩法律雷区的前提，也是这条「上线前测试—上线后观测」闭环能长期运转的保障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>上线后靠两条数据流观测质量：崩溃报告（为什么崩）与行为遥测（玩家卡在哪），把广阔现实变成可量化信号。</li>\n<li>Crashpad/Breakpad 在崩溃瞬间生成 minidump，需用归档的符号文件符号化才能还原调用栈，是「提高捕获率」策略的落地。</li>\n<li>Sentry 等平台聚类崩溃、按崩溃率排优先级，2025 年起覆盖主机；无崩溃会话率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - S_c/S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是核心健康指标（常守 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>99.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">99.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.5%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上）。</li>\n<li>行为遥测做漏斗分析定位设计卡点（通过率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{out}/N_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），但只答「在哪流失」不答「为什么」，且走设计反馈而非缺陷库。</li>\n<li>遥测撞上 GDPR 等隐私法规，须同意、最小化、脱敏、设保留期，合规数据采集是线上闭环长期运转的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"遥测与崩溃分析","id":"遥测与崩溃分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"崩溃捕获：Crashpad、Breakpad 与 minidump","id":"崩溃捕获-crashpad-breakpad-与-minidump"},{"level":2,"text":"崩溃聚合平台与按崩溃率排序","id":"崩溃聚合平台与按崩溃率排序"},{"level":2,"text":"行为遥测：玩家在哪卡住","id":"行为遥测-玩家在哪卡住"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私、合规与数据治理","id":"隐私-合规与数据治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"游戏测试自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-testing-qa/automation-ops/test-automation"},"next":{"title":"可玩性测试与反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-testing-qa/automation-ops/playtesting-feedback"}}